[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17761.59, "timestamp": "04:56:01", "text": "我认为它很邪恶，而且只有一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17763.51, "timestamp": "04:56:03", "text": "所以我们不能一起玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17766.708, "timestamp": "04:56:06", "text": "就像我们必须玩一个一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17768.948, "timestamp": "04:56:08", "text": "我们需要有人做出反应。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17773.75, "timestamp": "04:56:13", "text": "是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17776.31, "timestamp": "04:56:16", "text": "所以，嗯，有点像边看边看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17780.03, "timestamp": "04:56:20", "text": "但你喜欢其中一个玩家。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17781.99, "timestamp": "04:56:21", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17784.31, "timestamp": "04:56:24", "text": "是的。正如我所说，游戏风格就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17787.27, "timestamp": "04:56:27", "text": "地点或其他反应。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17790.07, "timestamp": "04:56:30", "text": "是的。是的，我们可以做到。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17792.948, "timestamp": "04:56:32", "text": "那肯定很有趣。那会很有趣。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17799.03, "timestamp": "04:56:39", "text": "那该怎么称呼它呢？因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17801.39, "timestamp": "04:56:41", "text": "不能称之为游戏阴郁风格，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17805.83, "timestamp": "04:56:45", "text": "这样行不通。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17809.27, "timestamp": "04:56:49", "text": "不，我看到了一些我现场看过的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17811.43, "timestamp": "04:56:51", "text": "YouTube 和日本 YouTuber 一样，也做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17813.11, "timestamp": "04:56:53", "text": "它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17816.51, "timestamp": "04:56:56", "text": "他们管它叫什么？"}]